<title>Document</title></head><body><div id="i9a984429992341e98d1ba2ecab797647_1"></div><div style="min-height:42.75pt;width:100%"><div><font><br></font></div></div><div><font><br></font></div><div id="i9a984429992341e98d1ba2ecab797647_4"></div><div><font><br></font></div><div><img alt="innovatelogo-notextjpga.jpg" src="innovatelogo-notextjpga.jpg" style="height:57px;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:99px"></div><div><font><br></font></div><div><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:174%">FOR IMMEDIATE RELEASE</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:174%">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</font></div><div style="text-align:center"><font style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:174%">INNOVATE Corp. Announces Second Quarter 2024 Results</font></div><div style="text-align:center"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:174%">- Infrastructure&#58; DBM Global achieved second quarter revenue of $305.2 million  -</font></div><div style="text-align:center"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:174%">- Life Sciences&#58; R2 achieved record Glacial system sales in North America in the second quarter -</font></div><div style="text-align:center"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:174%">- Spectrum&#58; Broadcasting's growth driven by launch of new networks and cost-cutting efforts  - </font></div><div style="margin-top:6pt;text